      "scope": "25 reviewed writer/ownership cases and24 unchanged work cases pass the same private Qt SQL writer with separate source/config review and actual automatic Ubuntu Qt6.12 acceptance. STORAGE-011 adds24 passing migration cases (original22 plus two separately reviewed initial-U+FEFF regressions), ten independent frozen vectors, exact codec/catalog/schema/content identity, one whole-prefix transaction and explicit refusal/cancellation/uncertainty. Original reviewed stub-red and additive regression-review/red/fix history are retained. Author/root/different reviewer full78 pass; actual selected officialQt Ubuntu41310940283 at da7cbde passes pinned hashes, GNU13.3, Qt6.12/SQLite3.53.4, old49, requiredgreen7 and all24 unconditional migration cases. Existing writer API/allowlist and original assertions are unchanged. No domain schema/real repository adapter/application bundle/backup or update authority/recovery/power-loss/provider/platform release verification. STORAGETEST-012 additionally supplies16 separately reviewed immutable configuration/context byte-retention cases, independent2000-byte migration payload/digest and12opaque vectors, compiling stub API, actual selected officialQt green3/build/discovery and genuine postapproval16stub-red(exit8/allinitcleanup pass/0skip). Exact refs/documents/typed links and full-range byte codec are contracted; actual typed uint64 domain SQL codecs remain mandatory013/014/015. STORAGE-012 now implements the puremanifest and exactBLOBfind/retain through caller-owned existing sessions, with sourcec96 independentlyapproved8c4261d, author/root/reviewer full95 pass and actual automaticselectedQt41322157820 at2aadef3 old73/green7/green3/unconditional16 PASS. API/tests/contract/vectors/oldimplementations remainunchanged. Opaque-byte persistence only; no semantic config/evaluator, actual typednumeric SQL converters013/014/015, receipt/contribution/plan/application bundle, backup/recovery/powerloss/provider/platform release upgrade. STORAGETEST-013 adds22 independently reviewed receipt SQL cases, six full-range uint64 literal vectors and an exact10535-byte migration2 payload/13-object schema fixture. Actual fullapproval7df/rootb1 precedes selectedofficialQt41334070282 at5ffe currentgreen3/exact22discovery, then rootfirst22explicitunimplemented red(exit8/allinitcleanup pass/0skip/0.22s). DomainReceiptId1..MAX is preserved while purecodec0..MAX is contracted. New productioncodec/manifest/repository remain explicit stubs; no passing receipt SQL behavior or DB-01 release upgrade is claimed."
